{"asset_key":"ep4/env_story_14301331","episode":"ep4","category":"env_story","story_id":"14301331","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1430133101:0":{"text":"是的，因为我家的火鸡又跑掉了。","source_cn":"是的，因为我家的火鸡又跑掉了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCDB8B9CDC95FA9DA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1430133102:0":{"text":"它们总是趁我不注意跑到北边的山坡上，我和女儿四处找它们，可我们一旦靠近，它们就扑扇着翅膀飞得更远……","source_cn":"它们总是趁我不注意跑到北边的山坡上，我和女儿四处找它们...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x63C6B737C48782C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1430133103:0":{"text":"以前我丈夫在家的时候，火鸡很听他的话，也许它们也想他了吧。","source_cn":"以前我丈夫在家的时候，火鸡很听他的话，也许它们也想他了吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC2E7FB79D757D5E3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:弗瑞达":{"text":"弗瑞达","source":"弗瑞达","status":"source"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}